* Berth
** Accounts (AUTH)
*** Register, log in, profile
*** Roles and rate-limited login
** Search (SRCH)
*** Station suggestions
*** Trains between stations
** Availability and fare (AVL)
*** Segment-aware berths
*** Fare breakdown with GST
** Booking and payment (BKG, PAY)
*** 1 to 6 passengers
*** Berth allocation or waitlist
*** Simulated gateway
left side
** Tickets (TKT)
*** PNR and PDF e-ticket
*** Public PNR status
** Cancellation (CAN)
*** Full or partial
*** Rule-based refund
** Waitlist and chart (WL)
*** Automatic promotion
*** Chart at 18:00 the day before
** Administration (ADM)
*** Stations, trains, routes
*** Runs, chart, dashboard
** Scheduled jobs (JOB)
@endmindmap
